## When to Activate
Activate Font Intelligence whenever Cascade handles:
- Front-end typography, CSS stylesheets, Tailwind config, or UI styling.
- Font pairings, typeface recommendations, and visual hierarchy scales.
- Platform-specific font integration (Web, Flutter, React Native, PowerPoint, Word).
- Font readability audits, multi-script checks, or licensing verification.

## Execution Workflow
- **CLI Recommendation**: `python scripts/recommend.py --use-case <id> --style "<vibe>" --platform <web|flutter|powerpoint>`
- **Catalog Search**: `python scripts/search_fonts.py --mood "<vibe>" --role <body> --min-readability 8`
- **Pair Scoring**: `python scripts/score_pair.py --primary <id> --secondary <id> --style <vibe>`
- **Offline / Direct Mode**: Read `catalog/fonts.json`, `catalog/use-cases.json`, and `catalog/pairings.json`.
- **Compact Fallback**: Use [`lite/font-intelligence-lite.md`](file:///d:/font-intelligence/lite/font-intelligence-lite.md).

## Hard Constraints
- Never invent fonts, unverified weights, or language scripts.
- Never use decorative or display typefaces for body or dense UI text.
- Respect explicit user font choices (anchor and pair around them).
- Maximum 2 primary families (heading + body), plus monospace only if needed.
- Full details in [`.agents/skills/font-intelligence/SKILL.md`](file:///d:/font-intelligence/.agents/skills/font-intelligence/SKILL.md).
